      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty harsh take. You're basically saying their whole premise is wrong from the start. \n\nDon't you think there's at least some merit to the idea that people need a sense of belonging to a specific community to feel stable? Like, can a society actually function if everyone is just a \"global citizen\" with no local ties?",
